  (vector "90-docs/adr/2607121000-cloud-itonami-global-isic-isco-reverse-toposort-plan.edn（ISCO occupation-actor track の全体計画、Wave3: production/trades、最終5件バッチのうちの1件）"
   "https://github.com/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isco-9611（直接の参照実装、outdoor-route hazard-domain の itonami actor パターン共通形）"
